{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":2,"ref":"ezra 4:2","book":"ezra","lang":"de","chapter":4,"translation":"Und sie traten heran zu Serubbawel und zu den Häuptern der Väter und sagten zu ihnen: „Lasst uns mit euch bauen, denn wie ihr suchen wir eurem Elohim ⟨zu dienen⟩; und ⟨auch⟩ wir opfern seit den Tagen Esar-Chaddons, des Königs von Aschur, der uns ⟨את⟩ hierher heraufgeführt hat.“","tokens":[{"surface":"ויגשו","gloss":"Und sie traten heran"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"zu"},{"surface":"זרבבל","gloss":"Serubbawel"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"und zu"},{"surface":"ראשי","gloss":"den Häuptern"},{"surface":"האבות","gloss":"der Väter"},{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"und sagten"},{"surface":"להם","gloss":"zu ihnen"},{"surface":"נבנה","gloss":"Lasst uns bauen"},{"surface":"עמכם","gloss":"mit euch"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"ככם","gloss":"wie ihr"},{"surface":"נדרוש","gloss":"wir suchen"},{"surface":"לאלהיכם","gloss":"eurem Elohim"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"und ⟨auch⟩ wir nicht"},{"surface":"אנחנו","gloss":"wir"},{"surface":"זבחים","gloss":"opfern"},{"surface":"מימי","gloss":"seit den Tagen"},{"surface":"אסר","gloss":"Esar"},{"surface":"חדן","gloss":"Chaddons"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"des Königs"},{"surface":"אשור","gloss":"von Aschur"},{"surface":"המעלה","gloss":"der heraufgeführt hat"},{"surface":"אתנו","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"uns"},{"surface":"פה","gloss":"hierher"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T15:29:08.165331168Z","model":"glm-5.2"}